doors.org/interfaith_celebrities_the_brat_pack_/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d104\"},\"ref\":\"d104\",\"snippet\":\" ... Life\\n\\nAt the time of filming this 2000 thriller about a kidnapping, leading lady Meg Ryan had been married to actor Dennis Quaid, with whom she has a son, for nine years. But it wasn't solid enough to survive an off-screen romance with her co-star ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/films/features/films-affairs-actors-marriages-divorce-b2543069.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d105\"},\"ref\":\"d105\",\"snippet\":\" ... He starred as President Fitzgerald Grant III on Scandal (2012–18) while also directing a number of episodes, for which he won a Peabody Award. Since 2024, he has starred as District Attorney Nicholas Baxter on Law & Order.\\n\\nEarly life\\n\\nGoldwyn was born in Los Angeles, California, the ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tony_Goldwyn\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"e8871de0ed8e159bbb9acc207ba7c05270cba1a255e7868722c1bf8f96de05a2\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b594940f57476c55a5c74c9a8a35d0c7fa47a6f73b365b1c6d64905d038bc07a\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Scandal character married three times children real life relative co-star\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_3501cc5ad92f40c99bee8dcb"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; no